Subject: [PATCH] test(kanban): prove projection and strict parser boundaries
 [daveey]

Add direct release nomination, terminal producer, retained-row projection, canonical UUID, append-owned envelope and identity-policy controls. Preserve all production authorization. Proof: canonical targeted consumers and full scripts/check green; exact-removal mutation outputs retained separately with original survivors, not relabeled as exhaustive acceptance.
---
